# EAS Build archive filter.
#
# eas-cli builds the upload archive from .gitignore files only — it does NOT read
# .git/info/exclude, so `.pragma/worktrees/` (whole extra checkouts, tens of GB) was
# being uploaded on every build. When this file exists it REPLACES the root
# .gitignore for archive purposes, so the root rules are repeated here verbatim.
# Nested .gitignore files (apps/*, packages/*) still apply.

# --- copy of the root .gitignore ---
node_modules/
.pnp.*
.expo/
dist/
apps/pragma/src-tauri/resources/plugins/
apps/pragma/src-tauri/resources/web/
build/
out/
.turbo/
target/
**/src/generated/
rust_out
qtest.typescript
apps/*/src-tauri/gen/
coverage/
.DS_Store
*.local
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
bench-report.json
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.fallow/
.tokensave
.playwright-mcp/
.rwx/downloads/
.vercel
.env*.local

# --- EAS-only exclusions ---

# Pragma's own worktrees: full checkouts living inside the repo. Excluded from git
# through .git/info/exclude, which eas-cli does not honor.
.pragma/

# Marketing videos/screenshots (~70 MB). The mobile build never reads them.
apps/www/public/media/
apps/www/public/*.png

# Desktop icon sources; the mobile app has its own under apps/pragma-go/assets.
apps/pragma/src-tauri/icons/
apps/pragma/src-tauri/icons-dev/

# CI definitions and git internals.
.github/
.rwx/
.husky/

# Local native prebuilds. `expo prebuild` / `expo run:ios` generate these, and they
# hold absolute paths from the machine that ran them (`.xcode.env.local`, the Pods
# xcconfigs). They are ignored by apps/pragma-go/.gitignore, but a root .easignore
# appears to suppress nested .gitignore files too, so they must be named here: build 11
# uploaded a 454 MB archive and died in `Run fastlane` with
# `…/node_modules/hermes-compiler/hermesc/osx-bin/hermesc: No such file or directory`
# — the worker running the uploader's local hermesc path. EAS prebuilds on its own.
apps/pragma-go/ios/
apps/pragma-go/android/
